				Plb.
				32.3.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				192
			</span></i> : abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφήτης ὁ παρεξεστηκώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ho.</u>
					9.7
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυλίκιον παρεξεστηκός</span>
			wine <i>that has turned, sour</i> wine, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				2.3
			</span></i>.</div>
